# the Rings: SEQ again from the Pulse page. Each ring's hits (Auto; turned up, the count playing, kept), Moves; SELECT
# held, each ring's turn. With the piece; gone with the recipe. A project from Dream's build (format 14) keeps its
# settings, the Rings on Auto.
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 5
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 11
expect par70 0
expect ring0 2
shot auto.png
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par70 3
expect ring0 2
spin K1 2
wait 100
expect par70 5
expect ring0 4
# no hats in the recipes: the closed hat on Auto plays none, and turned up starts there
spin K2 3
wait 100
expect par71 1
expect ring1 0
spin K2 4
wait 100
expect ring1 4
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect par76 1
press SEL
wait 200
shot turns.png
spin K1 2
wait 100
expect par73 2
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 11
shot set.png
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 5
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par70 5
expect par73 2
expect par76 1
expect ring0 4
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par70 0
expect par76 0
expect ring0 2
storev14 13
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 13
expect par70 0
expect par74 2
expect par75 3
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 13
expect par70 0
